Nakama client method-routing behavior study
The bounded Rust routing repair studies the pinned Nakama server/api.go routing
callback and apigrpc/apigrpc.pb.gw.go registrations, Copyright 2018 The Nakama
Authors under Apache-2.0. The diagnostic runner extracts the exact callback into
a temporary main package, retaining its license header and marking that
modification, and invokes the original generated gateway and vendored runtime.
Source identities and the restricted method-error cases are recorded in
contracts/http/nakama-routing-v1.json. No Go code is added to the Rust service.
